note hub/src/30-shell.om: what every page shares: head, navigation, page header, footer.
note
note Routes: 0 overview, 1 stack, 2 evidence, 3 omegese, 4 protocol; 11..16 are the protocol's own
note pages, routes 1..6 of 60-protocol.om (quick-start, concepts, adapter, conformance, status, forge).
note BASE (the site's address, like https://interplane.io) is an argument, so the same build can be
note published under any address; nothing else in a page is absolute except links to other sites.

note bas: offset and length of BASE in src
global bas ulong 2

